00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Doctor Who: The Next Doctor is a science fiction, tv
movie, mystery film directed by Andy Goddard.

2
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:54,000
The Doctor arrives in Victorian London.

3
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:18,000
It's Christmas, but snow isn't the only thing descending on the tranquil and jubilant
civilization, as familiar silver giants from an alternate reality are amassing in numbers.

4
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:42,000
The Cybermen are on the move again, and the only beings
who can stop them are the Doctor and...

5
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
another Doctor?

6
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:30,000
The Doctor, played by David Tennant.

7
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Jackson Lake, played by David Morrissey.

8
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:18,000
Miss Hartigan, played by Dervla Kirwan.

9
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Rosita, played by Velile Tshabalala.

10
